OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors approve controversial 
OL,4,Aharbour plans                          
OL,6,FCouncillors have voted in favour of a  
OL,7,Fmultimillion-pound plan to redevelop a 
OL,8,Ftown's docks.                          
OL,10,FThe proposals for Falmouth Docks in    
OL,11,FCornwall would allow large vessels     
OL,12,Fincluding cruise ships to dock there   
OL,13,Fbut opponents have voiced criticism    
OL,14,Fabout the potential impact on the      
OL,15,Fenvironment.                           
OL,17,FCornwall Council's Strategic Planning  
OL,18,FCommittee approved the shoreside       
OL,19,Felement of the #150m plans with seven  
OL,20,Fvotes in favour and three against. The 
OL,21,Fdredging plans are to be considered    
OL,22,Fseparately.                            
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
