OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors approve controversial 
OL,4,Aharbour plans                          
OL,6,FAbout 100 protesters gathered outside  
OL,7,FCounty Hall in Truro ahead of the      
OL,8,Fmeeting with one describing the scheme 
OL,9,Fas an "absolute environmental          
OL,10,Fcatastrophe", but those behind the     
OL,11,Fplans said they would boost the        
OL,12,Feconomy.                               
